WEBVTT

00:00:07.802 --> 00:00:09.929
You might want to
save your money, ragazzi.

00:00:10.012 --> 00:00:12.098
This year, Ercole's gonna
break the record

00:00:12.181 --> 00:00:13.975
and make it six in a row.

00:00:14.058 --> 00:00:16.519
(LAUGHING) Oh, no. I don't believe it.

00:00:16.602 --> 00:00:19.188
Spewlia, you teamed up
with these vagrants?

00:00:19.272 --> 00:00:20.439
-(LAUGHS)
-Ignore him.

00:00:20.523 --> 00:00:21.816
Oh, I wish for you that you could.

00:00:21.899 --> 00:00:24.318
I'm afraid your friends still need to pay

00:00:24.402 --> 00:00:25.987
the out-of-town weirdo tax.

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:27.071
(SNAPS FINGERS)

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.199
Hey! Ercole!
You have to give it back!

00:00:30.283 --> 00:00:31.951
Ercole doesn't have to do anything.

00:00:32.034 --> 00:00:33.786
He's the Portorosso Cup champion,
number one.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:34.871
And number two,

00:00:34.954 --> 00:00:36.414
his life is amazing
and everyone loves him.

00:00:36.497 --> 00:00:38.916
They don't love you.
They're afraid of you.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.002
(SPUTTERS) Raise your hand
if you love me.

00:00:41.252 --> 00:00:42.712
See? Everyone.

00:00:42.795 --> 00:00:44.380
Even you. Bop!

00:00:44.463 --> 00:00:46.048
Oh, that's it. Come on, Luca.

00:00:46.132 --> 00:00:48.009
Hey! The vagrants want to fight.

00:00:48.092 --> 00:00:49.093
Wow! (REMARKS IN ITALIAN)

00:00:49.177 --> 00:00:50.845
-Alberto?
-Silenzio, Bruno.

00:00:50.928 --> 00:00:52.597
Remember, this is for our Vespa.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:53.973
-Stop.
-A Vespa?

00:00:54.056 --> 00:00:55.057
(LAUGHS MOCKINGLY)

00:00:55.141 --> 00:00:56.726
Trash like you can't ride Vespas.

00:00:56.809 --> 00:01:00.146
Ercole, you're just afraid
we're gonna put an end to your

00:01:00.229 --> 00:01:01.981
-evil empire of injustice.
-"Evil empire of injustice."

00:01:02.064 --> 00:01:03.524
(SIGHS) Got anything new?

00:01:03.608 --> 00:01:06.944
Yeah. Here's a new one.
You look like a, uh... Uh...

00:01:07.028 --> 00:01:08.946
-A catfish.
-A catfish!

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:10.406
CROWD: Huh?

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:11.491
(SCOFFS)

00:01:11.574 --> 00:01:12.575
Uh, they're bottom-feeders,

00:01:12.658 --> 00:01:14.327
and they also have
two sad little whiskers.

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:16.454
-(GASPS)
-(CROWD LAUGHING)

00:01:16.537 --> 00:01:17.663
-(GUIDO SNORTS)
-Shut up!

00:01:17.747 --> 00:01:18.748
(GUIDO GRUNTS)

00:01:20.166 --> 00:01:21.667
Listen, piccoletto,

00:01:21.918 --> 00:01:24.629
I eat kids like you for breakfast.

00:01:24.712 --> 00:01:27.632
I dunk them in my cioccolata and...

00:01:27.715 --> 00:01:29.258
(MIMICS CHOMPING) ...finiti!

00:01:29.342 --> 00:01:31.052
-(MIMICS KNIFE SWISHING)
-(LUCA GULPS)

00:01:31.135 --> 00:01:33.054
So, here, sign up. Mm?

00:01:33.137 --> 00:01:35.681
I'll make it my mission to destroy you.

00:01:35.765 --> 00:01:38.935
(LAUGHS)
It's gonna be some race, huh?

00:01:39.393 --> 00:01:41.938
Sorry, no autographs today.

00:01:42.021 --> 00:01:43.606
-You can put your hand down.
-(KID GROANS)

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:47.902
Ha-ha! Luca! Bravo, we did it!

00:01:50.446 --> 00:01:51.489
Giulia Marcovaldo.

00:01:51.572 --> 00:01:53.407
Ciao, Giulia. Team of one?

00:01:53.491 --> 00:01:54.742
Not today.

00:01:54.909 --> 00:01:57.453
-Luca Paguro.
-Alberto Scorfano.

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:00.623
GIULIA: Okay, ragazzi,
we have one week to train.

00:02:00.915 --> 00:02:02.917
(COMMANDS IN ITALIAN)

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.043
I got this.

00:02:04.377 --> 00:02:05.419
Wait, what?

00:02:05.503 --> 00:02:07.088
Every year they change the pasta.

00:02:07.171 --> 00:02:08.798
You have to be ready for anything.

00:02:08.881 --> 00:02:13.094
Could be cannelloni, penne,
fusilli, trofie, even lasagne.

00:02:14.011 --> 00:02:17.223
And you have to use a forchetta.
It's the rule.

00:02:17.306 --> 00:02:20.768
Ugh! Rules are for rule people. (GRUNTS)

00:02:23.479 --> 00:02:24.939
(LUCA PANTING HEAVILY)

00:02:27.775 --> 00:02:28.818
(ALBERTO GROANS)

00:02:31.946 --> 00:02:34.407
Holy carp. No. I can't.

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:36.242
I know, I know. (LAUGHS)

00:02:36.951 --> 00:02:39.078
And remember, piccoletto...
(MIMICS KNIFE SWISHING)

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:44.458
Forza, Luca, don't let him get
in your head. You can do this.

00:02:44.542 --> 00:02:47.837
Okay. Silenzio, Bruno. Here we go.

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:50.173
(WHIMPERING) I can't!

00:02:50.756 --> 00:02:52.258
(SCREAMING)

00:02:52.341 --> 00:02:53.384
-(CRASHING)
-(ALL GROAN)

00:02:53.467 --> 00:02:54.677
(GROANS)

00:02:56.137 --> 00:02:57.221
(GIULIA GASPS)

00:02:58.723 --> 00:03:00.808
I guess that's how humans swim?

00:03:00.892 --> 00:03:02.476
Ugh, that's embarrassing.

00:03:03.436 --> 00:03:04.562
Any sea monsters?

00:03:04.645 --> 00:03:08.065
No. But I see some bait. (LAUGHS)

00:03:08.149 --> 00:03:09.484
(BOAT ENGINE ROARING)

00:03:10.610 --> 00:03:12.737
GIULIA: Oh, no! It's Ercole! Go, go!

00:03:13.404 --> 00:03:15.239
ALBERTO: Luca! Faster, faster!
LUCA: Why aren't we moving?

00:03:15.823 --> 00:03:17.200
-Ercole?
-(GASPS)

00:03:18.493 --> 00:03:19.535
-(GUIDO GRUNTS)
-(CICCIO YELPS)

00:03:20.745 --> 00:03:21.913
(YELPS)

00:03:21.996 --> 00:03:23.164
-Guido!
-I... I slipped.

00:03:23.247 --> 00:03:24.499
Ciccio, slap Guido.

00:03:24.749 --> 00:03:26.000
Again. Like you mean it.

00:03:26.083 --> 00:03:27.752
(GIULIA EXCLAIMS IN ITALIAN)

00:03:27.835 --> 00:03:28.836
(BOTH GRUNT)

00:03:29.462 --> 00:03:30.755
-Huh?
-(GASPS)

00:03:31.756 --> 00:03:33.424
Hmm. Where did the other one go?

00:03:35.635 --> 00:03:37.303
-Eh? (QUESTIONS IN ITALIAN)
-GIULIA: Ercole!

00:03:37.386 --> 00:03:39.472
-Whoa! (GRUNTING)
-(GIULIA QUESTIONS IN ITALIAN)

00:03:39.555 --> 00:03:40.556
(EXCLAIMS IN ITALIAN)

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:43.643
Giulia! It is wool. It cannot get wet!

00:03:43.726 --> 00:03:45.728
Ciccio, make it dry, subito!

00:03:45.812 --> 00:03:47.980
-(LUCA WHIMPERS)
-GIULIA: Luca? Alberto?

00:03:48.356 --> 00:03:49.440
Are you okay?

00:03:49.524 --> 00:03:50.942
-Um...
-We're good! Good, good, good.

00:03:51.025 --> 00:03:53.069
GIULIA: Well, I think that's
enough training for today.

00:03:53.152 --> 00:03:54.570
-LUCA: Yeah. Agreed.
-Yup.

00:03:55.279 --> 00:03:58.908
Ah, Ciccio! The motor!
They are slowly getting away!

00:03:58.991 --> 00:03:59.992
-(GRUNTS)
-(ERCOLE GROANS)

00:04:00.076 --> 00:04:01.285
Guido, slap Ciccio.

00:04:01.369 --> 00:04:02.370
(EXCLAIMS IN ITALIAN)

00:04:02.453 --> 00:04:03.996
-With contempt!
-(CICCIO GRUNTS)

00:04:05.623 --> 00:04:07.083
-KID: Huh?
-Hmm.

00:04:07.166 --> 00:04:09.085
(KIDS SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY)

00:04:11.838 --> 00:04:13.214
Hey! (SPEAKS ITALIAN)

00:04:13.297 --> 00:04:14.298
Kick it.

00:04:14.924 --> 00:04:16.300
-(GRUNTS)
-(GIRL GRUNTS)

00:04:17.093 --> 00:04:18.094
Oh!

00:04:18.469 --> 00:04:19.470
(GASPS)

00:04:19.554 --> 00:04:20.847
I have an idea.

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:21.931
Uh-uh. Honey?

00:04:22.014 --> 00:04:23.850
Hey, guys! Can I play, too?

00:04:23.933 --> 00:04:24.934
-(YELPS)
-Oops, sorry!

00:04:25.017 --> 00:04:26.060
I'm not used to legs. (LAUGHS)

00:04:26.143 --> 00:04:27.562
Oh. Okay.

00:04:27.645 --> 00:04:28.646
(BOY SPEAKS ITALIAN)

00:04:28.729 --> 00:04:29.814
-Get the ball!
-(SCOFFS)

00:04:29.897 --> 00:04:30.898
Come and get it!

00:04:31.816 --> 00:04:33.109
-Uh-uh!
-(KIDS GRUNTING)

00:04:33.985 --> 00:04:35.570
-(KIDS GROAN)
-Not our kid, not our kid.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:38.322
-(GRUNTING)
-(KIDS YELPING)

00:04:39.615 --> 00:04:40.741
(PANTING)

00:04:40.825 --> 00:04:42.076
(GASPS IN FEAR)

00:04:42.869 --> 00:04:44.453
-(GRUNTS)
-(WHISTLES, YELPS)

00:04:45.121 --> 00:04:46.455
(CHEERS IN ITALIAN)

00:04:46.539 --> 00:04:47.999
-(GROANS)
-Ha-ha!

00:04:48.583 --> 00:04:50.251
-(GRUNTING)
-(KID YELPING)

00:04:50.334 --> 00:04:51.669
(PANTS)

00:04:51.794 --> 00:04:54.672
Let's see Bianca Branzino do that!

00:04:54.755 --> 00:04:55.840
(MIMICS DOLPHIN TRILLING)

00:04:55.923 --> 00:04:56.924
GIULIA: Good effort, team.

00:04:57.008 --> 00:04:58.009
You've earned your pasta tonight.

00:04:58.092 --> 00:04:59.093
ALBERTO:
Can I please eat with my hands?

00:04:59.177 --> 00:05:00.178
DANIELA: Where could he be?

00:05:00.261 --> 00:05:02.263
LORENZO: Well, at least you won. I think.

00:05:02.346 --> 00:05:03.973
Yeah, I guess I did.

00:05:04.056 --> 00:05:05.850
Come on. We just gotta keep looking.

00:05:11.481 --> 00:05:12.565
Uh...

00:05:12.648 --> 00:05:15.651
Alberto? I think
I might've seen my parents.

00:05:15.735 --> 00:05:17.987
No way. I told you,
they're not coming here.

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:19.405
But what if they did?

00:05:19.489 --> 00:05:20.698
They're gonna send me to the deep.

00:05:20.781 --> 00:05:22.658
Listen, relax. It's never gonna happen.

00:05:22.742 --> 00:05:23.743
All right, boys.

00:05:23.826 --> 00:05:25.995
Pretty good today,
but let's talk technique.

00:05:26.078 --> 00:05:28.789
Hey, ragazzi! I need some help
with the nets.

00:05:28.873 --> 00:05:31.250
You. The big, strong one.

00:05:31.334 --> 00:05:32.627
-Andiamo.
-I'll be right back.

00:05:36.672 --> 00:05:37.882
(SIGHS)

00:05:37.965 --> 00:05:39.425
Hey, we're gonna win.

00:05:39.592 --> 00:05:41.469
And you'll get your Vespa.

00:05:41.886 --> 00:05:43.596
Why do you want a Vespa, again?

00:05:43.679 --> 00:05:45.515
Oh. Because it'll be amazing.

00:05:45.598 --> 00:05:48.476
Every day, me and Alberto
are gonna ride someplace new.

00:05:48.559 --> 00:05:51.103
And every night,
we'll sleep under the fish.

00:05:51.187 --> 00:05:54.148
The fish? (CHUCKLES DRYLY) Good.

00:05:54.232 --> 00:05:56.567
How about you?
What'll you do when you win?

00:05:56.651 --> 00:05:58.861
(EXCLAIMS) I'll get up
in front of everyone

00:05:58.945 --> 00:06:00.947
and say, "Told you I'd win!"

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:02.281
Yeah.

00:06:02.657 --> 00:06:03.866
And then what?

00:06:04.033 --> 00:06:05.451
Well, that's it.

00:06:05.535 --> 00:06:06.744
Look, during school,

00:06:06.828 --> 00:06:08.704
I live with my mamma in Genova.

00:06:08.788 --> 00:06:10.581
And every summer, I come here,

00:06:10.665 --> 00:06:13.251
and everyone thinks
I'm just some weird kid

00:06:13.334 --> 00:06:14.877
who doesn't belong.

00:06:14.961 --> 00:06:16.003
(LUCA SIGHS)

00:06:16.462 --> 00:06:17.797
I think I know how you feel.

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.799
Right? That's why we gotta win.

00:06:19.882 --> 00:06:21.217
The town will cheer our names.

00:06:21.634 --> 00:06:24.345
Ercole's life will be ruined! (GASPS)

00:06:24.428 --> 00:06:25.680
Sorry. Too much?

00:06:25.763 --> 00:06:27.765
My mom says sometimes I'm too much.

00:06:27.849 --> 00:06:29.642
No way. Not for me.

00:06:29.725 --> 00:06:30.726
(CHUCKLES)

00:06:31.227 --> 00:06:33.771
You know those aren't fish, right?

00:06:33.855 --> 00:06:37.024
Of course they are.
Alberto told me all about it.

00:06:37.525 --> 00:06:38.526
Come with me.

00:06:45.616 --> 00:06:47.118
-(SNORING)
-(INDISTINCT TV CHATTER)

